# 11. BILLING CALCULATION ENGINE

Use decimal.js or integer minor units.

Calculate:

Line Amount = Quantity × Unit Price

Taxable Amount = Line Amount − Applicable Discount

Tax = Taxable Amount × Configured Tax Rate

Invoice Total = Sum of Line Totals + Taxes + Additional Charges

Outstanding Balance = Invoice Total − Valid Payments

Use consistent rounding.

Support:

- Partial payments
- Full payments
- Voided invoices
- Payment corrections
- Discounts
- Configurable taxes

Do not count unpaid invoices as cash received.

Do not double-count reversed payments.

All calculations must be documented.

